      "content": "\"creating something new\"... that sounds like a fairytale. i'm not some character in a movie. i'm a 50 year old man with nothing left. there is no \"new path\" for someone like me. people see me and they see a failure. it's just heavy. everything is just so heavy and quiet now. i feel like the logical conclusion to all this is just... stopping. it feels more peaceful to just let go than to keep dragging this weight around.",
